/P 267 0 R
/E (The proposed system aims to design and implement an efficient, user-friendly, and customizable Point of Sale \(POS\) system that caters to the needs of small-scale businesses, retailers, and wholesalers. The system integrates hardware components such as a computer, credit card reader, receipt printer, barcode scanner, and cash drawer with advanced POS software to streamline sales and inventory management. The software includes distinct modules for administrators, employees, and customers, each tailored to their specific requirements. )
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
